name: sim.buildMatrix
description: Builds a transformation matrix based on a position vector and Euler angles
luaSynopsis: list matrix = sim.buildMatrix(list position, list eulerAngles)
pythonSynopsis: float[12] matrix = sim.buildMatrix(float[3] position, float[3] eulerAngles)
inputs:
1. position: array of 3 values
2. eulerAngles: array of 3 values
outputs:
1. matrix: array of 12 values [Vx0 Vy0 Vz0 P0 Vx1 Vy1 Vz1 P1 Vx2 Vy2 Vz2 P2]
